<title>USA: Fed adds reserves via weekend system repos.</title>
<headline>Fed adds reserves via weekend system repos.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve injected reserves into the banking system on Friday via over-the-weekend system repurchase agreements, a New York Fed spokeswoman confirmed.</p>
<p>The operation was generally expected by analysts.</p>
<p>Federal funds were at the Fed's target rate at the time of the open market intervention.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1867 ))</p>
